      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Assignment 2 — Complaint Sorter\n\n**Flow:** webhook → Switch on `complaint_type` → set team (fallback = General Team) → reply\n\n---\n\n### 🧪 Delivery\n\n```json\n{ \"complaint_type\": \"delivery\", \"customer\": \"Meera\", \"details\": \"Parcel arrived late\" }\n```\n\n### 🧪 Payment\n\n```json\n{ \"complaint_type\": \"payment\", \"customer\": \"John\", \"details\": \"Charged twice\" }\n```\n\n### 🧪 Product\n\n```json\n{ \"complaint_type\": \"product\", \"customer\": \"Sara\", \"details\": \"Item was damaged\" }\n```\n\n### 🧪 Fallback\n\n```json\n{ \"complaint_type\": \"website\", \"customer\": \"Ali\", \"details\": \"Page will not load\" }\n```\n",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 620,
        "color": 4
      },
